      ],
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Behavior\n\n## Implemented behavior\n\nedgeClassRegistry loads the default collection; deriveEdgeClassFromGraphPayload derives each rule. The editor and validator share edgeLegality. Core classes live in the content repository, so changing runtime code alone cannot publish a new class rule.\n\n## Known gaps\n\nLoad order and remote publication are deployment concerns. Tests loading local class graphs verify local contracts, not that the remote collection has been deployed.\n\n## Open decisions\n\nNo additional decision is required to describe the behavior above. Changes to that contract require an explicit task; implementation gaps are not implied approvals.\n\n## Evidence\n\nSource (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/edgeClass.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/edgeClassRegistry.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/edgeLegality.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/coreEdgeClasses.test.js`\n- `tests/edgeLegality.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-edge-class",
          "nodeId": "edge-class-behavior"
        }
      }
    },
